# Test of Loyalty's modal choice is made by Bot2; Tell Me What You See only triggers when its controller Bot1 faces a dilemma (CR 603.2, 700.2a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Tell Me What You See
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Test of Loyalty
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tell Me What You See.Cast
Bot2.Accept
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Test of Loyalty.Cast
Bot2.Modes(1)
Bot2.Target(Bot2.Graveyard.Black Lotus)
! Bot1.Accept
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Swamp; Tell Me What You See
Bot2.Graveyard = Test of Loyalty
Exile = Black Lotus
